# Line endings.
#
# This add-on is developed on Windows, but the CI in .github/workflows/ci.yml
# runs on ubuntu-latest, and anyone cloning may be on either. `text=auto`
# stores every text file with LF *inside the repository* while still checking
# it out with the platform's own convention, so a Windows editor keeps CRLF
# locally and Linux keeps LF, with no whole-file diffs when the two meet.
#
# Without this, the first commit from Windows would bake CRLF into the repo
# and every later diff from a Linux contributor would show every line as
# changed.
* text=auto

# Binaries -- never convert, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.psd binary
*.svg text
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.blend binary
